  "meta": {
    "title": "Japan Found 7,000 \"New\" Islands 🇯🇵🤯",
    "description": "In 2023 Japan recounted its islands and the number jumped from 6,852 to 14,125 🇯🇵🏝️ No new islands appeared: better surveying and digital maps simply found more islands with a coastline of at least 100 meters 🗺️ Only about 260 of them are inhabited, and Honshu alone holds over 80% of the population 🗼 By area, Japan is the fourth-largest island country, after Indonesia, Madagascar and Papua New Guinea 🤯",
